<p>Whilst wearing leather or lighter armour, you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 16%, 24%, 29%, 34%</acronym> Defense and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 11%, 16%, 21%, 25%</acronym> Armour hardiness.</p>